# Keep the build context small, and keep secrets out of every image layer.

# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.wrangler
**/.astro
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Git and editor state
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets and local env: never in an image
**/.dev.vars
**/.dev.vars.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.secrets*
**/*.pem

# Private notes, planning docs and screenshots
docs/
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude
apps/web/e2e/shots

# Python SDK virtualenvs and caches
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
